## Model

`{{ namespace }}\{{ class }}`, table `{{ table }}`.

Uses `BelongsToAccount`, so every query is already filtered by the account in
context and every new record is stamped with it. Do not add a manual
`where('account_id', ...)`.

Uses `LogsActivity`: creates, updates and deletes are recorded with the causer.

