## Permissions

`{{ permission }}.view`, `{{ permission }}.create`, `{{ permission }}.update`,
`{{ permission }}.delete`. Declared in `config/base-tenant.php`; run
`php artisan k2labs-base:sync-roles` after changing who holds them.

## Anti-patterns

```php
// ✗ The scope already does this, and this version forgets the console and
//   forgets queued jobs.
{{ class }}::where('account_id', session('account_id'))->get();

// ✓
{{ class }}::all();
```
